# An image wider than a request may carry (9000 pixels; the limit is 8000) is
# attached, and withheld at send: no file part, and fx's note in front of the
# prompt's text naming the session's saved copy. The note is the model's, not
# the screen's: the receipt is the request body. `wide.png` is a PNG signature
# and an IHDR declaring 9000x10, made at launch.
models models-image.json
gateway image-turns.json
work image-ws
pnghdr wide.png 9000 10
wait 3
type /image wide.png
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap attached
type  describe
key Enter
wait 4
snap sent
gwlog
home end
